{"question_id":"ptwo-charges-of-5-q-and--2-q-are-situated-at-the-p-jee-main-physics-units-and-measurements-e16cw5qilwcbfoq1","qKey":"ptwo-charges-of-5-q-and--2-q-are-situated-at-the-p-jee-main-physics-units-and-measurements-e16cw5qilwcbfoq1","permalink":"ptwo-charges-of-5-q-and--2-q-are-situated-at-the-p-jee-main-physics-units-and-measurements-e16cw5qilwcbfoq1","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift","year":2024,"subject":"physics","chapter":"electrostatics","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"<p>Two charges of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.921ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1291 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.681ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 2069 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are situated at the points <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.225ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2751.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1418,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1862.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2362.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.986ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3529.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1167,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1667,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2196,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2640.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3140.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> respectively. The electric flux through a sphere of radius '<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.328ex\" height=\"1.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 1029 687\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>' having center at origin is :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.061ex\" height=\"3.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -975 1352.9 1437\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(357.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1112.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.061ex\" height=\"3.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -975 1352.9 1437\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(357.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1112.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.061ex\" height=\"3.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -975 1352.9 1437\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(357.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1112.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.061ex\" height=\"3.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -975 1352.9 1437\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(357.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1112.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>"}],"correct_options":["D"],"explanation":"<p>The electric flux through any closed surface is given by Gauss's law, which can be stated as:</p>\n\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.08ex\" height=\"3.45ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1062.8 4013.6 1524.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(999.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2055.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,565) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(824,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">enc</text></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(659.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1718\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n\n<p>where:</p>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.633ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 722 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> = electric flux</li>\n    <li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.857ex\" height=\"2.313ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 2146.8 1022.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(824,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">enc</text></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> = total charge enclosed by the surface</li>\n    <li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.042ex\" height=\"1.397ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -452 902.6 617.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> = permittivity of free space (electric constant)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>In this scenario, we have a sphere of radius <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.328ex\" height=\"1.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 1029 687\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> with its center at the origin and two charges, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.921ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1291 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> at point (3a, 0) and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.681ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 2069 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> at point (-5a, 0). Since the sphere's radius is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.328ex\" height=\"1.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 1029 687\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.921ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1291 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, which is located at (3a, 0), lies inside the sphere, whereas the charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.681ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 2069 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, located at (-5a, 0), lies outside the sphere. Gauss's law only considers charges that are enclosed within the surface.</p>\n\n<p>Thus, the charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.681ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 2069 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> has no impact on the electric flux through the sphere because it is not enclosed by the sphere. Only the charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.921ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1291 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> contributes to the electric flux inside the sphere.</p>\n\n<p>The electric flux through the sphere is therefore given simply by the enclosed charge:</p>\n\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.711ex\" height=\"3.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -975 3408.4 1437\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(999.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2055.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(357.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1112.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>","exam":"jee-main","questions":[{"question_id":"ptwo-charges-of-5-q-and--2-q-are-situated-at-the-p-jee-main-physics-units-and-measurements-e16cw5qilwcbfoq1","qKey":"ptwo-charges-of-5-q-and--2-q-are-situated-at-the-p-jee-main-physics-units-and-measurements-e16cw5qilwcbfoq1","permalink":"ptwo-charges-of-5-q-and--2-q-are-situated-at-the-p-jee-main-physics-units-and-measurements-e16cw5qilwcbfoq1","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift","year":2024,"subject":"physics","chapter":"electrostatics","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"<p>Two charges of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.921ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1291 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.681ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 2069 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are situated at the points <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.225ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2751.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1418,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1862.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2362.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.986ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3529.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1167,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1667,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2196,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2640.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3140.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> respectively. The electric flux through a sphere of radius '<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.328ex\" height=\"1.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 1029 687\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>' having center at origin is :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.061ex\" height=\"3.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -975 1352.9 1437\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(357.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1112.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.061ex\" height=\"3.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -975 1352.9 1437\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(357.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1112.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.061ex\" height=\"3.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -975 1352.9 1437\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(357.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1112.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.061ex\" height=\"3.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -975 1352.9 1437\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(357.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1112.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>"}],"correct_options":["D"],"explanation":"<p>The electric flux through any closed surface is given by Gauss's law, which can be stated as:</p>\n\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.08ex\" height=\"3.45ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1062.8 4013.6 1524.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(999.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2055.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,565) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(824,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">enc</text></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(659.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1718\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n\n<p>where:</p>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.633ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 722 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> = electric flux</li>\n    <li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.857ex\" height=\"2.313ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 2146.8 1022.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(824,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">enc</text></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> = total charge enclosed by the surface</li>\n    <li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.042ex\" height=\"1.397ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -452 902.6 617.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> = permittivity of free space (electric constant)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>In this scenario, we have a sphere of radius <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.328ex\" height=\"1.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 1029 687\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> with its center at the origin and two charges, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.921ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1291 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> at point (3a, 0) and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.681ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 2069 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> at point (-5a, 0). Since the sphere's radius is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.328ex\" height=\"1.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 1029 687\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.921ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1291 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, which is located at (3a, 0), lies inside the sphere, whereas the charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.681ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 2069 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, located at (-5a, 0), lies outside the sphere. Gauss's law only considers charges that are enclosed within the surface.</p>\n\n<p>Thus, the charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.681ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 2069 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> has no impact on the electric flux through the sphere because it is not enclosed by the sphere. Only the charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.921ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1291 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> contributes to the electric flux inside the sphere.</p>\n\n<p>The electric flux through the sphere is therefore given simply by the enclosed charge:</p>\n\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.711ex\" height=\"3.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -975 3408.4 1437\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(999.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2055.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(357.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1112.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>","exam":"jee-main"}]}